            <description><![CDATA[
<h2>CryptoNotch 1.1.0</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Reorderable Favorites:</strong> Organize pinned favorite coins via smooth drag-and-drop in the switch pair popover.</li>
  <li><strong>Streaming Performance:</strong> Cached number formatters eliminating heap churn on high-frequency ticker updates.</li>
  <li><strong>Optimized Network Pipeline:</strong> Deduplicated WebSocket events and ephemeral REST snapshots.</li>
</ul>
            ]]></description>
